{"pin":"AB00802","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00802","anchor":"","first_line":"O thou favored maidservant of the Kingdom of God! The letter, which thou hast written, was received. Its contents evinced high aspiration…. The Temple is the most great foundation of the world of humanity and it has many branches","first_line_orig":"مشرق الأذکار از اعظم تأسيسات عالم انسانيست و تفرّعاتش بسيار است مشرق الأذکار اگر چه محلّ عبادتست  ","language":"Per","word_count":"440","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK4.151.04x","source":"AVK4","locator":"151.04x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK4/ak4-155.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#064 p.097x","source":"MMK1","locator":"064 p.097x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/299849152"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#065 p.098x","source":"MMK1","locator":"065 p.098x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/299849156"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BSC.465 #866-867x","source":"BSC","locator":"465 #866-867x","url":"http://bahai-library.com/compilations/bahai.scriptures/"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BWF.416-416x","source":"BWF","locator":"416-416x","url":"https://archive.org/details/bahaiworldfaithselectedwritingsofbahaullahandabdulbaha./mode/2up"},{"kind":"translation","code":"LOG#2056x","source":"LOG","locator":"2056x","url":"http://bahai-library.com/hornby_lights_guidance_2.html\u0026chapter=5#n2056"},{"kind":"translation","code":"PN_unsorted p073x","source":"PN_unsorted p073x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/p/pilgrims_notes_us-archives_unsorted.pdf#page=73"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SWAB#064x","source":"SWAB","locator":"064x","url":"http://www.bah